  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering women in STEM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#x201c;Empowering women in STEM&#x201d; is a program aimed at eliminating gender inequality in STEM-related fields by enhancing their skills and advancing social participation of young women pursuing STEM-related fields. Zorig Foundation has a proven track record of successfully implementing such programs, with a total of 40 graduates as of 2024. 

This initiative will mainly focus on empowering women in the STEM fields, and will strengthen the leadership and soft skills of female professionals that will help them challenge the barriers faced by women in STEM fields. The project will also expand their network and assist them in identifying potential opportunities in STEM fields.</narrative>
  </description>
